extual_provisional","rationale":"按明示姓名及局部語境承接；武臣與趙歇、張敖的趙王用稱限各段，張黡張黶按同行事件暫接但原字分存。未名者不補姓名。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["孝文帝","文帝"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:p028","quote":"張敖已出，以尚魯元公主故，封爲宣平侯。於是上賢張王諸客，以鉗奴從張王入關，無不爲諸侯相、郡守者。及孝惠、髙后、文帝、孝景時，張王客子孫皆得爲二千石。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:p029","quote":"張敖，髙后六年薨。子偃爲魯元王。以母呂后女故，呂后封爲魯元王。元王弱，兄弟少，乃封張敖他姬子二人：壽爲樂昌侯，侈爲信都侯。髙后崩，諸呂無道，大臣誅之，而廢魯元王及樂昌侯、信諸侯。孝文帝即位，復封故魯元王偃爲南宮侯，續張氏。"}]}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:p028","text":"張敖已出，以尚魯元公主故，封爲宣平侯。於是上賢張王諸客，以鉗奴從張王入關，無不爲諸侯相、郡守者。及孝惠、髙后、文帝、孝景時，張王客子孫皆得爲二千石。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m028-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"張敖","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004997","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m028-0007","start":7,"end":11,"surface":"魯元公主","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004999","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m028-0021","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004988","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m028-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"張王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004997","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m028-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"張王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004997","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m028-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"孝惠","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005030","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m028-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"髙后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005027","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m028-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005005","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m028-0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"孝景","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005031","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m028-0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"張王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004997","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger","book_id":"b-shiji-089","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-089-zhanger"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:p029","text":"張敖，髙后六年薨。子偃爲魯元王。以母呂后女故，呂后封爲魯元王。元王弱，兄弟少，乃封張敖他姬子二人：壽爲樂昌侯，侈爲信都侯。髙后崩，諸呂無道，大臣誅之，而廢魯元王及樂昌侯、信諸侯。孝文帝即位，復封故魯元王偃爲南宮侯，續張氏。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"張敖","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004997","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"髙后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005027","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"子偃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005000","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"魯元王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005000","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"呂后女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004999","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"呂后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005027","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0027","start":27,"end":30,"surface":"魯元王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005000","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"元王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005000","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"兄弟","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者或未定指代保留原文，不補成員姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"張敖","kind"